- ACTION: Change the default slidingTendency to 'up' (and reorder the select options) so the default state matches the source figure, where friction on A points down-slope opposing the tension-driven upward tendency
- ACTION: Remove the ±18–26° cosmetic rotations on f_AB, f_B, and N_AB in panel (b); draw them strictly parallel/perpendicular to the incline and instead adjust label offsets to prevent collisions
